{"id":11440,"date":"2024-10-29T16:51:00","date_gmt":"2024-10-29T16:51:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=11440"},"modified":"2026-05-27T09:09:32","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T09:09:32","slug":"smart-home-technology-integration-in-remodels","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/smart-home-technology-integration-in-remodels\/","title":{"rendered":"Smart Home Technology Integration in Remodels"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As technology continues to advance, smart home integration is becoming a key component of modern remodeling projects. Homeowners in areas like <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-bend\/\">Bend, OR<\/a>, Portland, OR, Redmond, OR are increasingly looking to incorporate smart technology into their homes, not only to enhance convenience but also to improve energy efficiency and security. Whether you\u2019re planning a kitchen remodel in Gresham, OR, or a full home renovation in Happy Valley, OR integrating smart home technology can transform your living space into a more connected and efficient environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/1353600-me-1024x614.webp\" alt=\"Mobile device \" class=\"wp-image-11444\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Benefits of Smart Home Technology in Remodeling<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Smart home technology offers a multitude of benefits, making it an essential consideration for any remodeling project. Here are some of the key advantages:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Energy Efficiency<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Integrating smart thermostats, such as the Nest or Ecobee, into your home can significantly reduce energy consumption. These devices learn your schedule and preferences, automatically adjusting the temperature to save energy when you\u2019re not home. In locations like Happy Valley, OR, where temperatures can vary, smart thermostats ensure that your home is always at the optimal temperature without wasting energy.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart lighting solutions<\/strong> like Philips Hue allow you to control your lights remotely, set schedules, and even adjust brightness and color based on the time of day. This not only enhances convenience but also reduces energy costs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Enhanced Security<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Smart security systems are becoming a popular choice for homeowners in Ridgefield, WA, and West Linn, OR. With devices like Ring doorbells, smart locks, and security cameras, you can monitor your home from anywhere, providing peace of mind whether you\u2019re at work or on vacation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart locks<\/strong> offer keyless entry, which can be particularly useful for families. You can grant access to guests or service providers remotely, and receive notifications when someone enters or leaves your home.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Convenience and Control<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Voice-controlled home technology, such as Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant, allows you to control various aspects of your home using simple voice commands. Whether you\u2019re cooking in your newly remodeled kitchen in Hillsboro, OR, or relaxing in your smart-enabled living room in Battleground, WA, you can control your lights, thermostat, and entertainment systems with ease.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Home automation systems<\/strong> bring all your smart devices together, offering centralized control through a smartphone app or a dedicated home hub. This seamless integration makes it easier to manage everything from lighting and security to heating and cooling.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/tv-living-room-with-window-2023-11-27-05-31-09-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Bedroom with wider space\" class=\"wp-image-11443\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Popular Smart Home Devices for Your Remodel<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When planning a remodel, it\u2019s essential to consider which smart devices will best suit your needs and lifestyle. Here are some of the most popular options:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Smart Kitchen Technology<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Smart refrigerators<\/strong> like Samsung\u2019s Family Hub offer features like touch-screen displays, interior cameras, and meal planning apps. These appliances can help you manage your grocery list, check expiration dates, and even stream music or TV shows while you cook.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart ovens and cooktops<\/strong> allow you to control cooking temperatures and settings remotely, ensuring your meals are cooked to perfection even when you\u2019re not in the kitchen.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Smart Bathroom Solutions<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Smart mirrors<\/strong> with built-in displays can provide weather updates, news, and even health tracking features while you\u2019re getting ready in the morning.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart showers<\/strong> offer customizable settings for water temperature, pressure, and even lighting. Some models can be controlled via a smartphone app, allowing you to start your shower remotely so it\u2019s ready when you are.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Smart Entertainment Systems<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Whole-home audio systems<\/strong> like Sonos can be integrated into your remodel, offering high-quality sound in every room. Whether you\u2019re hosting a party in your living room in Tigard, OR, or enjoying a quiet evening in your bedroom in Clackamas, OR, you can control your music with ease.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart TVs<\/strong> and home theaters with voice control and integrated streaming services allow for a more immersive and convenient entertainment experience.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/home-cinema-room-with-tv-hanging-on-blue-wall-2023-11-27-04-58-33-utc-1024x618.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11447\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Integrating Smart Home Technology into Your Remodel<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When incorporating smart home technology into your remodel, it\u2019s important to plan ahead to ensure a seamless integration. Here are some tips:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Consult with a Professional<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Working with a contractor who is experienced in smart home integration is crucial. Harris &amp; Sons, for instance, can help you design a remodel that seamlessly incorporates the latest technology into your home. Whether you\u2019re in Washougal, WA, or Tigard, OR, our team can guide you through the process of selecting and installing the best smart devices for your needs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Plan for Future Upgrades<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Technology is constantly evolving, so it\u2019s important to choose devices and systems that are future-proof. Opt for devices that can be easily upgraded or expanded, and ensure that your home\u2019s wiring and network infrastructure can support future smart tech advancements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Focus on Compatibility<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>When selecting smart devices, choose ones that are compatible with each other and can be integrated into a single home automation system. This will make it easier to control all your smart devices from a single app or hub.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Prioritize Security<\/strong>:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>As you add more smart devices to your home, it\u2019s essential to prioritize security. Make sure your home network is secure, and consider using devices with built-in security features, such as encryption and two-factor authentication.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Smart home technology integration is more than just a trend\u2014it\u2019s a way to enhance your home\u2019s efficiency, security, and convenience. From energy-saving smart thermostats to state-of-the-art security systems, the possibilities for transforming your home are endless. At <strong><a title=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a><\/strong>, we specialize in incorporating smart technology into remodeling projects, helping homeowners in places like Felida, WA, and Lake Oswego, OR, create connected, efficient, and modern living spaces. Ready to take your remodel to the next level? <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">Contact us today<\/a><\/strong> to learn how we can integrate the latest smart home technology into your next project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As technology continues to advance, smart home integration is becoming a key component of modern remodeling projects. Homeowners in areas like Bend, OR, Portland, OR, Redmond, OR are increasingly looking to incorporate smart technology into their homes, not only to enhance convenience bu